# Jacobian perturbation captures (hundreds of near-identical JPEGs, ~70 MB); the
# measurements they produced are in iter1/tune_cam*.jsonl.  Base/final/before/after
# captures and all diagnostics stay tracked.
iter1/tune_cam*_j[0-9]*.jpg
iter1/tune_cam*_expo[0-9]*.jpg
iter1/tune_cam*_awb[0-9]*.jpg
# REPL transcripts: they contain every downloaded JPEG as base64 (tune_repl.log = 52 MB)
iter1/*repl*.log
iter1/locate.log
iter1/*_capture.log
